          Clean attribution, AI referrer detection, and organic revenue without heavy enterprise bloat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto max-w-[960px] mx-auto rounded-3xl border border-[#3D3830] bg-[#1B1811] p-2 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl">
