              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-semibold text-[#F6F3EB]">
                <div>SEO Organic Revenue Attribution</div>
                <div class="text-xs font-normal text-[#A79E8C]">Match organic landing pages + dates to revenue</div>
              </td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-black text-primary">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-primary">
                  <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
